---
const pageTitle = "How I can help";
const description =
  "Ways I can help with your website development, from coding and designing to writing, maintenance and support, and help with grant applications.";
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import whatsApp from "../assets/whatsapp-button.svg";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle={pageTitle} description={description}>
  <p>
    I work with research projects at every stage, from the grant proposal to the
    point where the funding ends. You can hire me for the whole thing or just
    the parts you need.
  </p>
  <ul class="grid-container">
    <li>
      <div>
        <img src="/images/create-websites.svg" height="60" alt="" />

        <h2>Make websites</h2><p class="mt-3">
          I create small to medium websites with a design and technology that
          suits your needs. Code can be hosted on GitHub.
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div>
        <img src="/images/maintain-websites.svg" height="60" alt="" />
        <h2>Maintain websites</h2><p class="mt-3">
          I can maintain existing websites, including updating content and
          adding new features.
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div>
        <img src="/images/edit.svg" height="60" alt="" />
        <h2>Create content</h2><p class="mt-2">
          I can write and edit text based on documents you have, like grant
          applications or academic papers. I can also coordinate content from
          stakeholders, and create illustrations.
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
    <li>
      <div>
        <img src="/images/advise.svg" height="60" alt="" />
        <h2>Advise</h2><p>
          I can make sure you meet legal requirements for the site, like for
          accessibility (WCAG compliance) and privacy (GDPR). We can also
          discuss UX exercises to improve the usability of the site.
        </p>
      </div>
    </li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Help with grant applications</h2>
  <p>
    If you are writing a grant application for a EU-funded project (like a
    Horizon Europe project) or another academic project and need an idea of cost
    then let me know. I can help you think through the simplest technical
    solution, and estimate a cost to put in the funding proposal.
  </p>
  <h2>Planning for the project end</h2>
  <p>
    We can plan from the start how the website will be archived, either by
    handing over to a partner institution or by taking a static copy and hosting
    it for free on GitHub.
  </p>
  <h2>Use of AI</h2>
  <p>
    I use AI where it saves you time and money, such as checking code and fixing
    bugs. It can be hugely beneficial, but it also needs to be used with
    caution. If you're interested in using AI in your project, we can to discuss
    where it would be most helpful.
  </p>

  <!-- <h2>Training</h2>
  <p>
    In addition, I also give <strong>training</strong> in basic web technologies.
    This includes how websites and Content Management Systems work, and the basics
    of HTML, CSS and Javascript.
  </p> -->

  <div class="tinted full-width mt-6">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 class="contact">Contact</h2>
      <p>Get in touch if you'd like to talk through your project.</p>
      <div class="text-primary text-xx-large mt-0 mb-1">07455 624491</div>
      <div class="mb-3">
        <a href="mailto:martin@martincookdesign.co.uk"
          >martin@martincookdesign.co.uk</a
        >
      </div>
      <div>
        <a aria-label="Chat on WhatsApp" href="https://wa.me/7455624491">
          <Image
            src={whatsApp}
            alt="WhatsApp button"
            layout="constrained"
            width={190}
            loading="lazy"
          />
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <h2>The technologies I can help with</h2>
  <p>
    There are a huge number of ways you can make a website or application, and
    no-one can be proficient in all of them. Here are some technologies I've
    worked with before:
  </p>
  <ul class="mb-0">
    <li>
      Content management systems: WordPress, Drupal, Kirby CMS, SharePoint
    </li>
    <li>Static site builders: Astro, Jekyll</li>
    <li>JavaScript frameworks: Next.js, Gatsby</li>
    <li>Also: custom PHP/MySQL applications, online shops (Volusion)</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Portfolio</h2>
  <p>
    See the <a href="/about/">About page</a> for my experience and portfolio.
  </p>
</BaseLayout>
